 "remarks": "A premier, spacious colonial on a 1-acre quiet, private lot at the end of a cul de sac in the Compo Beach area, across from Longshore. 3 BRs, 2 baths upstairs, 1 BR and bath on 1st floor. Deck off the Dining Room, screened porch & patio off the family room. Gracious sun-filled living room, family room, dining room. and eat-in kitchen. Great expansive views from all windows. Enjoy nature in a quiet location easy walking distance to the beach and Longshore Golf Course, drive to town, and easy access to the train. Many fine restaurants and fantastic shopping Great area for cyclists, runners, and walkers. This winter rental is available from Dec 3, 2026.",
